+Owner-accepted R3 application observation policy D-18: 30s base between status checks, honor longer server Retry-After, absolute 4,200s deadline from initial start issuance including async handling and 3,600s replica allowance. Deadline never implies termination; stop automatic observation and classify unknown/recover operationally. Provider/platform scheduling overhead can exhaust this budget before a replica finishes; it is an intentional bounded observer, not completion SLA. Exact acceptance is retained in owner-decision-response-r3-pending.json; effective behavior remains Stage7. Jobs event pollingInterval (30s default) polls event sources, not execution status or ADF.
