+# Task 5 public permission evidence and proposed matrix
+
+Public documentation collection only, observed 2026-10-06 UTC. No Azure, credential, tenant, SEC or deployment calls were made. JSON files are versioned curated source extracts rather than full page copies; source_version is the documented page update date where available, otherwise the explicitly rolling documentation state. The retrieved_at_utc fields identify collection-batch time anchors, not the exact timestamp of each individual HTTP request. sources-manifest.json contains SHA-256 of the exact retained JSON bytes. Failures are retained in retrieval-failures.json.
+
+This proposal assumes the parent's pending owner proposal: ADF system-assigned managed identity; distinct worker and pull user-assigned managed identities; dedicated registry in RBAC Registry Permissions mode. Concrete resource names, principal IDs and accepted deployment delegation conditions remain owner bindings. API versions are supplied by the sibling contracts work; Azure RBAC permission catalogs themselves are rolling, not API-version-specific.
+
+## Operation matrix
+
+Prefixes below expand literally: B = Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts/blobServices/containers/blobs/; T = Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts/tableServices/tables/entities/. Unless stated otherwise Actions and DataActions not listed are empty. Custom role definitions are proposals, not deployed or observed roles.
+
+| Actor / identity | Audience | API operations and exact permission set | Proposed role / assignment scope | Network / evidence / Stage 7 proof |
