+| ADF system-assigned MI | https://management.azure.com/ | Job GET/start and execution GET/list: Actions Microsoft.App/jobs/read, Microsoft.App/jobs/start/action, Microsoft.App/jobs/execution/read, Microsoft.App/jobs/executions/read | Custom job controller role assigned separately to each job resource | ARM HTTPS/DNS/TLS; jobs-actions.json, jobs-trust.json; test allow required operations and deny write/listSecrets |
+| ADF same MI | https://management.azure.com/ | Start Location polling: Actions Microsoft.App/locations/containerappsjoboperationresults/read and Microsoft.App/locations/containerappsjoboperationstatuses/read | Separate custom async observer assignment at subscription scope because documented Location routes are subscription/provider/location resources outside job/RG ancestry | ARM approved Location host/path; jobs-actions.json; actual 202 Location may select one action, remove unused action after Stage 7 verification. Generic locations/operationresults/read and operationstatuses/read are only conditional candidates if returned path uses generic routes |
+| ADF same MI | https://storage.azure.com/ | Get durable JSON result: DataAction B + read | Custom result reader at results container; built-in Storage Blob Data Reader is broader because it includes container reads/user delegation key action | Blob HTTPS/DNS/TLS/firewall; blob-roles.json, storage-operation-mapping.json; exact result read and unrelated container denial |
+| Worker UAMI | https://storage.azure.com/ | Blob GET/list + PUT/upload + lease acquire/renew/release: DataActions B + read, B + write | Custom blob worker assigned separately to raw/workset/result/quarantine/generation and lease containers used by worker | Blob endpoint public egress/firewall; blob-roles.json, lease.json; allow lifecycle, require lease IDs on guarded writes and test lease/CAS failure/takeover |
+| Worker UAMI | https://storage.azure.com/ | Table query/insert/conditional update: DataActions T + read, T + add/action, T + update/action | Custom entity worker at each source/attempt/pointer/approval table the application actually needs. Approval write should be withheld if collector does not own approval creation | Table endpoint; table-roles.json, storage-operation-mapping.json, table-cas.json, table-scope.json; prove 412 on stale ETag, no wildcard/missing If-Match |
+| Pull UAMI | ARM tokens accepted by ACR for Container Apps MI integration; general ACR-specific audience https://containerregistry.azure.net/ | Digest image pull: Action Microsoft.ContainerRegistry/registries/pull/read, no DataActions | AcrPull 7f951dda-4ed3-4680-a7ca-43fe172d538d at dedicated registry in legacy RBAC mode | Registry HTTPS/DNS/TLS and registry data endpoint; acr-roles.json, acr-modes.json, image-pull-arm.json, acr-audiences.json; actual pull with configured identity/digest and unrelated registry denial |
